<title>UK: Rabobank unit sets 300 mln guilder five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank unit sets 300 mln guilder five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    15.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    15.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	+8.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS =US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   EURO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
